### Get all businesses (default sort: NEWEST, default page: 0, size: 20)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses


### Get businesses with pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?page=0&size=5


### Get businesses by owner
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?ownerId=1


### Get businesses by category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?categoryId=1


### Get businesses by free-text search (matches name, description, category, location, or service)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?text=tuns


### Get businesses by location (matches locationName or address)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?location=Piezisa


### Get businesses by tags (must match all provided tags)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?tags=barber&tags=men


### Get businesses offering a specific service type
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?serviceTypeId=1


### Get businesses by service type and price range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?serviceTypeId=1&minPrice=30&maxPrice=100


### Get businesses by service type and availability date
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?serviceTypeId=1&date=2026-11-23


### Get businesses by service type, date, and time window (Afternoon: 12:00 - 18:00)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?serviceTypeId=1&date=2026-11-23&timeFrom=12:00&timeTo=18:00


### Get businesses by standalone price range, date, and time window (without serviceTypeId)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?minPrice=30&maxPrice=100&date=2026-11-23&timeFrom=12:00&timeTo=18:00


### Sort by name ascending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?sortBy=NAME_ASC


### Sort by name descending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?sortBy=NAME_DESC


### Sort by oldest first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?sortBy=OLDEST


### Sort by price ascending (with service type filter)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?serviceTypeId=1&sortBy=PRICE_ASC


### Sort by price descending (with service type filter)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?serviceTypeId=1&sortBy=PRICE_DESC


### Combined filters + sorting + pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?location=Cluj&categoryId=1&serviceTypeId=1&minPrice=30&maxPrice=150&date=2026-11-23&timeFrom=06:00&timeTo=12:00&sortBy=PRICE_ASC&page=0&size=10


### Validation test: minPrice > maxPrice (expect 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?minPrice=200&maxPrice=50


### Validation test: timeFrom > timeTo (expect 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?timeFrom=18:00&timeTo=12:00


### Validation test: past date (expect 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses?date=2020-01-01


### Get business by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses/1


### Get business by ID (expect 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses/999999


### Get all businesses (no filters, default pagination: page 0, size 20)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses/all


### Get all businesses (custom pagination)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/businesses/all?page=0&size=5